## 1\. Logical AND Operator (&&) Program:

This program evaluates whether both conditions a < b and b < c are true. If both conditions are true, it returns 1 otherwise it returns 0. This program checks if at least one of the conditions a < b or b > c is true. If either condition is true, it returns 1; otherwise, it returns 0.

```c
